WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
她：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
Her: (Doesn't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.029
她：我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛……怎么回事？
I'm the photographer upstairs. Your eyes… what's wrong with them?

00:00:25.229 --> 00:00:27.557
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:30.906
画外:Luca：Harland把订婚宣布提前了，还有十分钟。
画外:Luca: Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:31.106 --> 00:00:34.256
关掉车库监控，谁也别下来。
Kill the garage cameras. Nobody comes down.

00:00:34.456 --> 00:00:37.605
让我……就一次。我得确认你是真的。
Let me… once. I need to know you're real.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
她：什么叫我害的？你把话说清楚。
Her: What do you mean, I caused this? Explain yourself.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:42.633
原来你在这里。
There you are.

00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:45.161
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:45.361 --> 00:00:48.510
她：抱歉，我还有工作。
Sorry. I have work to do.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.860
封住所有出口。这一层没人能走。
Seal every exit. No one leaves this level.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.209
先生……您的眼睛。
Sir… your eyes.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
她：Mate是什么意思？你先说清楚再碰我。
Her: What does Mate mean? Explain it clearly before you touch me.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:00.237
Mate。一头狼，一个对的人。高于一切。
Mate. One wolf, one match. Above everything.

00:01:00.437 --> 00:01:02.765
现在你知道了。我不碰你。
Now you know. Not touching you.

00:01:05.477 --> 00:01:07.789
她：好，我跟你走。但你得全部说清楚。
Fine. I'll come. But you explain everything.

00:01:07.989 --> 00:01:10.301
开车。
Drive.

00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:12.813
现在我身上全是你的气味。每一头狼都会知道。
Your scent is on me. Every wolf will know.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
她：上车，坐到另一侧
Her: Get in the car and sit on the other side.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:20.369
好。就待在那儿。
Good. Stay right there.

00:01:23.081 --> 00:01:25.393
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:25.593 --> 00:01:27.905
让他们来。
Let them.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
她：谁会来找我？还有，刚才那是谁的电话？
Her: Who's coming for me? And whose call was that just now?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:35.445
Selene，我的未婚妻。我挂了她的电话。
Selene. My fiancée. I hung up on her.

00:01:41.522 --> 00:01:44.672
是我的气味。在这里到处都是。
It's my scent. Here, it's everywhere.

00:01:44.872 --> 00:01:48.021
我不是人类。这里没人能碰你。
I'm not human. Nothing here will touch you.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
她：不是人类？那你是什么？说清楚。
Her: Not human? Then what are you? Explain it clearly.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:53.049
我是狼。看着。
I'm a wolf. Look.

00:01:55.777 --> 00:02:00.601
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就走了。
I walked out on it the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:00.801 --> 00:02:05.625
Selene从来都不是我的。你在发抖。
Selene was never mine. You're shaking.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
她：握住他的手：我没在怕
Her: Takes his hand: I'm not afraid.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:10.653
她：我没在怕。
I'm not afraid.

00:02:10.853 --> 00:02:13.181
你的手在抖。
Your hand is shaking.

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:19.880
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:23.229
画外:Luca：Alpha，Arkwright小姐来了。
画外:Luca: Alpha. Miss Arkwright is here.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
她：外面是谁？我倒要看看她到底是谁。
Her: Who's outside? I want to see who she really is.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:28.257
让她进来。
Let her in.

00:02:28.457 --> 00:02:30.785
Arkwright小姐，请。
Miss Arkwright. Please.

00:02:30.985 --> 00:02:33.297
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:02:33.497 --> 00:02:35.809
她轮不到你过问。
She is not your concern.

00:02:36.009 --> 00:02:38.321
一个人类，Magnus？满月之前，长老会会把她带走。
A human, Magnus? The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
她：满月前带走我？你先说清楚，长老会凭什么。
Her: Take me before the full moon? Explain it clearly. What gives the Elders the right?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:45.861
族规说，Mate必须是狼族血脉。
The law says Mates must be Wolf-born.

00:02:50.599 --> 00:02:52.408
长老会没有资格碰你。
The Council has no right to touch you.

00:02:56.627 --> 00:02:58.437
Alpha，Harland已经召集了长老。
Alpha. Harland has called the elders.

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
她：我不想逃，我想留下
Her: I don't want to run. I want to stay.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:03.465
她：我不想逃，我想留下。
I don't want to run. I want to stay.

00:03:03.665 --> 00:03:05.993
再说一遍。
Say it again.

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:16.041
今晚留下来陪我。
Stay with me tonight.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
她：留下可以，先陪我去天台吹吹风。
Her: You can stay, but first come with me to the rooftop for some fresh air.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:21.069
带路吧。
Lead the way.

00:03:27.816 --> 00:03:29.626
那是长老会在召唤。
Better than a locked room?

00:03:31.835 --> 00:03:33.645

That's the Council calling.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
她：Harland是谁？长老会要对我们做什么？
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:38.673
Harland，最老的长老。他守着族规。
Harland. Oldest elder. He guards the law.

00:03:38.873 --> 00:03:41.201
他们要你今晚被交出去。
They want you handed over. Tonight.

00:03:41.401 --> 00:03:44.550
Alpha，长老们要她，就在今晚。
Alpha. The elders demand her. Tonight.

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.900
那就让他们当面听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.
